{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>孕婦在懷孕期間，總是希望能隨時感受胎兒的生命力。原價 US $0.99 的《Snuggly》是一款專為 iPhone 設計的胎音紀錄工具，讓準媽媽無需額外購買昂貴的胎心音器或任何外接配件，只需將手機麥克風貼近下腹部，就能在家中聆聽、錄下並與家人分享寶寶的心跳聲，為孕期增添無價的溫馨回憶。現正提供限時免費下載。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-187.webp\">\n<h2>獨家演算法過濾與放大音訊</h2>\n<p>《Snuggly》採用先進音訊演算法，能精準擷取並放大微弱的胎兒心跳聲。軟體直接利用 iPhone 麥克風收音，無需任何外接配件或訂閱。建議懷孕 22 週後在安靜環境配合耳機使用，幾秒內即可完成錄音並即時分享給親友，輕鬆記錄寶寶成長的溫馨瞬間。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-211-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-212-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-213-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-214-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-215-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-216-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Snuggly: Record Baby Heartbeat</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T20:38:33.282050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":357,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T20:21:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T02:17:44.678688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T20:37:33.511426+00:00","content_hash":"d05f63177a6111ce6f29c8a0b3dd78d72d57895e61362e77a45221d13a3b6c16","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}